^{:go/end 151} (go/method readFromUDP "readFromUDP implements ReadFromUDP.\n" [^{:tag (* UDPConn)} c ^{:tag (slice byte)} b ^{:tag (* UDPAddr)} addr] :results [int (* UDPAddr) error]
